Placeholder so the folder exists in Git.

Everything inside `models/` is ignored by Git. Run:

    python download_models.py

to place the three local artefacts here:

    models/silero_vad.onnx
    models/whisper-base/                 (config.json, model.bin, tokenizer.json, vocabulary.txt)
    models/qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf

Caches created at runtime also live here (hf_cache/, torch_cache/) so that no
file is ever written to the Windows user profile.
